A '''Divine Gift''' is an {{Epic}} [[Permanent Consumable]] item used to increase the player's {{Stat|mf}}.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Divine Gift''' can be purchased from the {{Zone|Regalia Room}}.

== Usage ==
Consuming a '''Divine Gift''' grants {{SBXP|+2}} and a permanent {{stat|mf|+1}}. Up to {{Green|5}} '''Divine Gifts''' can be consumed in total.

